  "description": "Full-featured image processing library built on SkiaSharp. Implements ILegioImageResizer, ILegioImageCropper, ILegioImageTransformer, and ILegioImageFilter interfaces. Provides fluent builder API for easy image manipulation. Supports resize, crop, rotate, flip, and filters (grayscale, sepia, blur, sharpen, brightness, contrast, invert). Format conversion for PNG, JPEG, WebP, BMP, and GIF. Cross-platform support for Windows, macOS, and Linux. Supports .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0.",
